05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you visit famous landmarks.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to take place", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to happen; to be set", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The movie takes place in Alcatraz.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "inmate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who spends time in a prison", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Al Capone was a famous inmate in Alcatraz.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "killer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a criminal who murders people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: \"Birdman of Alcatraz\" is a movie about a killer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cell", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small room where an inmate spends time in prison", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Al Capone's cell is very small.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sparrow", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small, brown bird", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The inmate feeds the sparrow every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "expert", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who knows a subject very well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is a bird expert.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to publish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to write a book for public sale", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He publishes books about birds.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Talking About Movies", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The group of people who make a movie are called the crew.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When a famous actor acts in a movie, he or she <span class=\"italic\">stars</span> in it.<br /> When a director makes a movie, you say that <span class=\"italic\">it is made by \u2026</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The story of a movie is also called the <span class=\"italic\">plot</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Film Crew/Filmmakers </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> What they do </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Writer \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Writes the screenplay     \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Director \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Makes the movie\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cameraman \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Shoots the scene\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Actor\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Performs; Plays the role of a  character\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "John Frankenheimer is the director of the \"Birdman of Alcatraz\".", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Burt Lancaster stars in it. He plays the main character.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Giving Directions in a Building", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use wh- questions to ask for directions in a building.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the Imperative, expressions and prepositions of place to give directions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Directions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Giving Directions </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is ... ?<br /> How do I get to ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Go straight ahead.<br /> Turn right/left.<br /> Walk across/through ...<br /> Take the stairs ... <br /> In front of ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Valerie</span>: Excuse me, where is the gift shop? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Guide</span>: It's across the yard, on your left.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of your favorite movie.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What is the title? What is the plot?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Who is the director?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Who is the main actor?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Why do you like it?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5-8 sentences about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your summary aloud to your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about movies.", "type": "text"},