</span>: It's right in front of you!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le02ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can ask and give directions in a building. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about movies. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can request and reply to information from a stranger.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Which famous movies about criminals do you know?  Do you like those kind of movies? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you like movies based on real-life situations? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's visit a famous prison! Where is it?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}]}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Aunt Nelly and the tour guide love movies. Is Vanessa  <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">a film buff</span>, too?", "type": "text"}], "type"